OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fa few outbreaks of light rain and
OL,7,Fdrizzle, although the odd clear spell
OL,8,Fis also likely to develop. Winds
OL,9,Fstrengthening through the early hours
OL,10,Fof the morning. Staying mild.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FBlustery rainband, locally
OL,13,Fheavy, moves east through the morning,
OL,14,Fclearing Kent early afternoon. Sunny
OL,15,Fspells follow, but staying breezy and
OL,16,Ffeeling mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
