OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FChilly
OL,6,Fstart Wednesday. Dry but increasingly
OL,7,Fcloudy, and mild into Thursday. Strong
OL,8,Fwinds, easing later Thursday. Rain
OL,9,Fspreading southeast overnight,
OL,10,Fclearing to sunny spells later Friday
OL,11,Fand feeling fresher.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
